WEBVTT

00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:09.034
Spaces is where your team writes down how things are done: procedures, notes, and documents. In this video, you’ll find a page, edit it, and share it.

00:00:10.058 --> 00:00:18.997
Open Spaces. Pick a space at the top of the page tree: your own My Space first, then the spaces shared with the company. Here are the store procedures.

00:00:20.638 --> 00:00:30.494
Pages are written in a rich editor, with headings, checklists, tables, and images. Give a page a cover photo, and every change is kept in its version history.

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:41.545
Important documents can go for approval, with the Approvals module on, and an approved page is marked Verified. Ask Assist to summarize the page you’re reading.

00:00:42.573 --> 00:00:51.277
Out-of-date pages go to the Archive, where they stay searchable. Deleted pages wait in Docs trash, where your System Admin can bring them back.
